    title: 'Is It Safe to Put Client Data Into AI Tools? | We Keep You Spry',
    description: 'Whether client, tenant or policyholder data is safe in ChatGPT, Claude or Gemini depends on the plan, the settings and who owns the account. What to check first.',
    eyebrow: 'QUESTIONS',
    h1: 'Is it safe to put client data into AI tools?',
    answer: 'It depends on the plan more than the brand. Individual ChatGPT and Claude accounts can use chats for model training unless the setting is off, while their business plans do not by default. The safer setup is a business plan, in an account the company owns, with written rules on what staff may paste in.',
